      'The workspace shell separates navigation, repository context, visualization controls and inspection. Long paths remain accessible through technical typography/overflow treatment. Graph navigation supports rotation, zoom, explicit panning and reset/recenter; viewport sizing and retained-coordinate fit avoid arbitrary offsets. Filters and selection should preserve orientation. The3D library remains an optional asset dependency with 2D fallback and pending distribution/license packaging checks.',
      'The finite motion system uses transform/opacity emphasis, bounded reveals, genuine integer count-ups, actual relationship traces, message entrances and pending-request indicators. It never changes analytical values or inserts fake processing delays. Reduced-motion preferences suppress nonessential effects, including camera animation; hiding/leaving the page cancels optional work and settles final values. Effects do not require a permanent animation loop.',
