    b=page('14','Security and Reliability','Bounded untrusted input and recoverable failures')
    p(b,'Archive extraction enforces25 MiB upload,100 MiB expansion,2 MiB per file,5,000 entries, depth 30,240-byte paths and compression ratio200. Path traversal, unsafe links and conflicting/duplicate entry behavior are validated by existing tests. The scanner does not execute repository programs, scripts or hooks. Temporary extracted files are removed after analysis. These are implemented safeguards, not a security certification or proof against every resource attack.',
      'GitHub intake restricts supported public repository destinations and redirects; timeouts and streamed response limits bound metadata/archive requests. Historical operations preserve SHA pinning, fixed GitHub API destinations, revision validation and operation budgets. Default history bounds include24 commits,100 files/commit,4,000 changes,5,000 tree files,200 comparison files,90 requests,12 MiB transfer and60 seconds per operation. Binary/unavailable/truncated line statistics remain explicit.',
      'History caching uses process-local bounded LRU/TTL public evidence,256 entries,16 MiB aggregate and2 MiB per entry. Keys scope repository, immutable revisions, operation arguments and credential scope. Compatible requests coalesce; cancellation of one waiter does not cancel shared work. Failures are not retained as successful evidence. Primary exhaustion, secondary cooldown, permission/authentication, missing records and network/provider errors are classified separately. Server-only optional GitHub tokens never enter snapshots, responses or logs. [7]',
      'Comparison patches are transient in the browser and short-lived/size-bounded when cached server-side, never persisted into analysis snapshots/export. Client deduplication, stale-response protection and cleanup prevent harmless rerenders from fetching identical data again. Previously loaded views remain usable after a failed comparison/tree operation. None of this guarantees unlimited GitHub access or removes external quotas.',
      'Model loading is operator-trusted only: joblib can execute code, so uploaded artifacts are never loaded. Version/digest/schema checks prevent silent feature/model mismatch. Repository-derived strings and assistant responses use safe text rendering, not arbitrary HTML insertion. Optional cloud transmission requires explicit consent and bounded minimal evidence; source comments are data, not commands. Local assistance avoids this transmission path entirely.',
      'Graph/rendering limits, finite animations, listener/observer cleanup and expiring browser retention reduce runaway work and stale state. Browser profile access remains a privacy boundary; the app is not an account-based multi-user secure repository host. Live operational penetration testing, accessibility certification and hardware performance certification are not claimed.')

    b=page('15','Limitations','Scientific and operational threats to validity')
    p(b,'Predictive performance is modest. RF historical-test AUC0.587354 is only moderately above random ranking, and validation accuracy barely exceeds the majority-negative baseline. Always-positive F1 is higher than RF F1 with zero specificity. These results constrain usefulness and make claims of reliable defect/vulnerability detection unjustified. The uncalibrated score is a research review signal, not a calibrated probability or bug verdict.',
      'The dataset concentrates on two projects and inherits historical labeling/sampling noise. Exact duplicate removal does not establish project/commit/time independence. Token-shape and bounded shingle audits identify related data without proving semantic clones; missed matches remain. Grouped CV and the794-row diagnostic improve transparency but do not create independent external validation. The official test was already viewed, and validation supports multiple historical/optimization decisions.',
      'Only C functions receive supervised predictions. Python has structural metrics, and other languages may receive inventory-only analysis. Parser errors, incomplete snippets, macro-heavy C, dynamic relationships and bounded traversal limit coverage. NaN imputation is honest missingness handling, but cannot restore absent semantics. Neither graph reachability nor architecture cycles guarantee runtime propagation or build-system behavior.',
      'Time Machine depends on genuine Git history, GitHub availability and a bounded pinned-revision window. ZIP metadata is not history. Comparisons use bounded text/tree evidence with conservative identical-blob rename detection; current model scores are not historical predictions. Limits can truncate ancestry, file lists or patches, and activity/churn is not productivity or code quality.',
      'Current browser screenshots and full mobile/GPU/accessibility acceptance remain incomplete in this environment. Automated DOM tests do not certify visual smoothness or real3D rendering. DOCX editable content can repaginate in Word/LibreOffice; PDF is the fixed-layout copy produced from the same evidence model. Academic placeholders, authentic captures and clean-checkout model/vendor packaging require final team review.')

    b=page('16','Future Work','Clearly unimplemented research and engineering extensions')
    p(b,'The most important scientific next step is independent evaluation: new appropriately licensed projects, time-separated records and stronger clone-aware grouping established before development. Curated label audits could distinguish labeling uncertainty from model failure. Such work should preserve official benchmarks for comparison while defining a new untouched evaluation protocol; repeatedly selecting on the exposed test would not solve generalization.',
      'Richer source representations, carefully controlled feature ablations and additional lightweight or learned models could be investigated under training-only tuning. Language-specific models require their own labeled datasets and validation rather than applying the C classifier to Python. Calibration and review-workload analysis should measure how estimates transfer to actual engineering decisions. Feature importance is not causal evidence and should be presented with stability/uncertainty checks.',
      'Engineering follow-up includes clean Ubuntu reproduction, complete third-party asset notices, authentic screenshot/recording capture, physical camera/touch testing, screen-reader review and measured integrated-GPU profiling. More historical coverage must respect API budgets and retained-evidence limits. Optional configured cloud synthesis could be validated separately with explicit consent; this report does not claim live provider readiness or add cloud integration.',
      'Repository DNA, expanded language intelligence, automatic repair and advanced history-aware learning remain future ideas. They are not implemented results, not prerequisites substituted for mandatory academic ML evidence, and not part of the validated production model.')

    b=page('17','Conclusion','A complete engineering workflow with candid empirical limits')
    p(b,'Codebase Archaeologist integrates secure repository intake, inventory, C/Python structure, stable dependency evidence and multiple dedicated exploration workspaces. Graph, Architecture, Heatmaps, Blast Radius, Jordan Local and Time Machine connect static and historical facts while retaining source identity and coverage. The interface and finite motion system aim to make investigation understandable; automatic tests substantiate contracts without substituting for rendered acceptance.',
      'The supervised study provides a reproducible CodeXGLUE/Devign pipeline, explicit cleaning and missingness policy, three original trained candidates and genuine C-only application inference. Random Forest remains selected with validation F1 0.520995 and previously exposed official-test F1 0.526316/ROC-AUC 0.587354. The controlled optimization extended features and model configurations, applied grouped CV/OOF thresholds and rejected replacements that failed the predeclared gate.',
      'The main research outcome is methodological understanding and an inspectable implementation, not a claimed predictive breakthrough. Shared-origin/clone concerns, modest ranking and the stronger always-positive F1 comparator demonstrate the need for multi-metric evaluation and independent data. Retaining the deployed model without inventing an improvement is an evidence-backed decision. Final submission should include honest metrics, editable documents, verified source links and a real team-reviewed demonstration.')

